      "text": "dcp_a2a_fused (Triton + All-to-All)\n\n• Triton 无损打包 O_j + FP32 LSE_j\n• 单次 all_to_all_single 按 Head 切分\n• LSE 权重归并: w_j = exp(L_j - max L)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "a2a_pack",
      "originalText": "dcp_a2a_fused (Triton + All-to-All)\n\n• Triton 无损打包 O_j + FP32 LSE_j\n• 单次 all_to_all_single 按 Head 切分\n• LSE 权重归并: w_j = exp(L_j - max L)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.28
    },
